  "notes": "Population/households are final ENUMERATED counts (census moment 00:00 15 June 2022, incl. floating population), not PEC-adjusted; BBS publishes adjusted figures only by division (Rajshahi Division adjusted 20,794,019). Unit lists and population per district/upazila/city corporation/thana/paurashava/union/ward from the Community Report Excel files, sheet C-01 (BBS 2022 geocodes; code_scheme BBS_GEOCODE_2022 = C-01 code columns joined with '-', prefixed by division 50). Administrative-unit counts, area and density from the District Report Key Findings tables (District Series, June 2024) and Union Statistics (June 2025) Table D01. The Naogaon District Report's Key Findings table contains Jamalpur data and is skipped. basis: enumerated | as stated (printed in a BBS table) | derived (counted from the C-01 geocode rows). Level 'cantonment' is used for Bogura Cantonment, which C-01 prints in the Union/Ward column. Large PDFs/Excel are not committed; fetch.py re-downloads them (bbs.gov.bd needs the Sectigo DV R36 intermediate, added at runtime from its AIA URL)."
